Needed while BOTH of these are in fork/branches.txt:
  fix/workspace-creation-race  (passes its transaction to getUserRole)
  feat/deployment-admins-all-workspaces
                               (deployment admins: getUserRole now also honours
                                the deployment-admin grant and takes no transaction;
                                the membership read became getMembershipRole)

Git merges the two without a conflict, but the result does not typecheck.
Inside the per-user lock the saved default is checked on the transaction
(membership, or the grant read before the lock), never on a second pool
connection. Whichever of the two pull requests upstream merges second must
carry this change itself; delete this file then.

